    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 266 of the laws of 1981, amending the civil practice law and rules relating to time limitations, in relation to extending time limitations for certain actions",
    "basePrintNo": "S7087",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7087-2015",
    "coSponsors": {
